---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import MainCard from "@/components/MainCard.astro";
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="项目">
  <MainCard title="项目实验室" description="硬件、固件与工具的实践项目。" textOverlay="PROJECTS" infoIcon="lucide:code-2">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <section class="py-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="lucide:star" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" /><span>Featured Projects</span></h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="card bg-base-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start"><Icon name="lucide:cpu" class="w-9 h-9 text-primary" /><span class="badge badge-success badge-outline">Completed</span></div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-5">IGCM15F60GA_FOC</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70 mt-2">一款基于 IGCM15F60GA 的无刷直流电机驱动板。</p>
            <div class="divider my-3" />
            <code class="text-sm">IGCM15F60GA · BLDC · FOC · 三相逆变器</code>
          </div>
          <a href="https://github.com/wuhuyixia/esp-meowpanion" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="在 GitHub 查看 ESP32-MEOWPANION 项目" class="card bg-base-200 p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start"><Icon name="lucide:terminal" class="w-9 h-9 text-primary" /><span class="badge badge-warning badge-outline">In progress</span></div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-5">ESP32-MEOWPANION</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70 mt-2">一个基于 ESP32 的 AI-Chat 设备。</p>
            <div class="divider my-3" />
            <code class="text-sm">ESP32 · AI-Chat · Wi-Fi · C++</code>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary"><Icon name="lucide:github" class="h-4 w-4" /> 查看 GitHub 项目</span>
          </a>
          <div class="card bg-base-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start"><Icon name="lucide:activity" class="w-9 h-9 text-primary" /><span class="badge badge-warning badge-outline">In progress</span></div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-5">EdgeMotion-CNN</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70 mt-2">基于 ESP32-S3 与陀螺仪的边缘动作识别系统。</p>
            <div class="divider my-3" />
            <code class="text-sm">ESP32-S3 · 陀螺仪 · CNN · Edge AI</code>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-200 p-6">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start"><Icon name="lucide:upload" class="w-9 h-9 text-primary" /><span class="badge badge-warning badge-outline">In progress</span></div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-5">AirOTA-C3</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70 mt-2">基于合宙 ESP32-C3 的 OTA 固件升级功能，可以通过网页或 OneNET 完成无线升级。</p>
            <div class="divider my-3" />
            <code class="text-sm">ESP32-C3 · OTA · Web · OneNET</code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="py-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="lucide:folder-code" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" /><span>更多实验</span></h2>
        <div class="card bg-base-200 p-6">
          <ul class="space-y-5">
            <li class="flex gap-4"><Icon name="lucide:camera" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary flex-shrink-0" /><div><h3 class="font-bold">RPi-CubeSolve</h3><p class="text-base-content/70">基于树莓派 4B，通过摄像头识别魔方六面色块，调用 Kociemba 算法计算还原步骤，并实时展示求解过程。</p></div></li>
            <li class="flex gap-4"><Icon name="lucide:waypoints" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary flex-shrink-0" /><div><h3 class="font-bold">电源模块 PCB 复盘</h3><p class="text-base-content/70">从布局、回流路径、去耦到示波器测量，整理一次完整硬件调试过程。</p></div></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="flex justify-center"><a href="https://github.com/wuhuyixia/learning-os" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline gap-2"><Icon name="lucide:github" class="w-5 h-5" /> 查看 GitHub 仓库</a></div>
    </div>
  </MainCard>
</BaseLayout>
